when u wanted to print information echo is useful.

echo -e \\e[COLCODEmHello World\\e[0m


          Forground       Background    Bright foreground   Bright Background
black       30            40            90                  100

red         31            41            91                  101

green       32            42            92                  102

yellow      33            43            93                  103

Blue        34            44            94                  104

Magenta     35            45            95                  105

cyan        36            46            96                  106

white       37            47            97                  107

0m : is to reset or normal
1m bold
4m : underline

Note : when we enabled colour, we should disable otherwise it will continue for next line


